# --- Packaging output: NEVER commit any of this ---
#
# `packaging/build.py` writes a ~261 MB folder and a ~109 MB zip. dist/ and
# build/ are matched by the Python block at the top of this file, which is
# easy to mistake for setuptools leftovers and "tidy up" -- so they are named
# again here, explicitly, with the reason.
#
# What IS committed on purpose: firmware/*.bin (the prebuilt board images the
# app flashes) and packaging/ itself (the spec and the build script).
dist/
build/
*.spec.bak
packaging/__pycache__/
